# Real-MIR shape corpus for the fixed-vector AArch64 legality slice.
# Types use the MIR spelling; scripts/coverage_report.py normalizes them
# to the DSL slot vocabulary (i8 -> s8, <4 x i8> -> v4s8).
---
name:            g_smin_0
body:             |
  bb.0:
    %0:_(<4 x i8>) = G_SMIN %1:_(<4 x i8>), %2:_(<4 x i8>)

